---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from "../../i18n/utils";
import { SmallForm } from "../../components/SmallForm";
import photo from "../../assets/imagess/rfid.jpg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

const theLang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(theLang as "en" | "es");
---

<Layout
  title="Radio Frequency Identification"
  description={`We offer Radio Frequency Identification (RFID) solutions for more accurate and efficient inventory management. Our RFID systems enable real-time tracking of products, reduction of losses, and optimization of logistical processes.`}
>
  <h1
    class="w-full py-5 laptop:py-8 bg-blue text-[22px] tablet:text-[26px] laptop:text-3xl
font-extrabold text-center text-white"
  >
    Radio Frequency Identification (RFID)
  </h1>
  <main
    class="flex flex-col w-full py-14 px-[5%] full:px-[15%] min-[1400px]:px-[20%] gap-10"
  >
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl laptop:text-5xl font-bold">RFID</h2>
      <p class="text-left">
        At PC Apps International LLC, we offer RFID (Radio Frequency
        Identification) technology solutions designed to <strong
          >optimize and transform your business’s inventory management and
          logistical operations</strong
        >. By contracting our RFID technology services, you will gain multiple
        added values that will significantly benefit your company.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={photo} alt={"Service Image"} class={`w-full rounded-lg`} />
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold pt-6">What Does It Involve?</h3>
    <ol
      class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 list-inside list-decimal text-justify marker:text-xl marker:font-semibold"
    >
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Customized Implementation and Consulting:</span
        >
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            Our experts work closely with your team to design and implement an
            RFID system that perfectly fits your business's specific needs. We
            provide continuous consulting and technical support to ensure a
            smooth integration.
          </li>
          <li>
            Maximizes the efficiency of the RFID system, ensures a seamless
            transition, and minimizes disruptions to daily operations.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Accuracy and Real-Time Visibility:
        </span>
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            RFID systems provide accurate, real-time data on the location and
            status of products in your inventory. This eliminates human errors
            and improves data accuracy.
          </li>
          <li>
            Enhanced inventory visibility, reduction of losses and
            discrepancies, and better decision-making based on accurate data.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Process Automation and Cost Reduction:
        </span>
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            With RFID technology, many manual processes can be automated,
            significantly reducing the time and effort required for inventory
            management.
          </li>
          <li>
            Operational cost savings, increased staff productivity, and freeing
            up resources for more strategic tasks.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Enhanced Security and Control:
        </span>
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            RFID technology allows comprehensive and secure tracking of products
            from production to point of sale. This enhances asset security and
            reduces the risk of theft or loss.
          </li>
          <li>
            Greater inventory control, reduction of losses, and protection of
            valuable assets.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Scalability and Adaptability:
        </span>
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            Our RFID systems are designed to grow with your business. They are
            highly scalable and can easily adapt to changes in demand or
            business expansions.
          </li>
          <li>
            Flexibility to meet future needs, ensuring a long-term investment
            that continues to provide value as your business grows.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Integration with Existing Systems:
        </span>
        <ul
          class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col gap-2"
        >
          <li>
            We offer solutions that seamlessly integrate with your existing
            inventory management and ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) systems,
            ensuring smooth interoperability.
          </li>
          <li>
            Improved operational efficiency, consolidation of data into a
            unified system, and reduction of information redundancy.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <!--     <section
      class="bg-sectionBg w-full min-[1500px]:min-w-[800px] full:min-w-[460px] flex flex-col items-center gap-8 px-4 tablet:px-4
      laptop:px-8 py-12"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-center">
          {t("nav.contactBtn")}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-center">{t("contact.formText")}</p>
      </div>
      <SmallForm lang={theLang} client:only />
    </section> -->
  </main>
</Layout>
